が、『堕落の儀式』においては協力者となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気分屋なところがあるので、今回も戯れで付き合っている節も……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17030","sourceWorkId":"10396","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"出自は夢魔の一族だが、かなり上位の階級に位置する高位の魔族。 古くから主人公と多岐に渡り、競い合ってきたライバル的な存在でもある。 魔性の女という評が良く似合う、淫蕩と享楽、そして謀略を愛する性格。 魔力を一時的に失った主人公のもとに現れ、『堕落の儀式』の協力者となる。 気分屋な彼女にとって、今回の件は遊びついでの暇つぶしに過ぎないのかもしれない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174721"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17030","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"178 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17030","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17030","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17030","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7ce05a24bf05ed548ba0685b324cb63c5f85966aedf9f3429b72b213289482bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68effd9fbfd70b5764aa8692938f7a32a1d1ec33205a728ba8ee25f6adc1f99a.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"MARIO","creatorId":"vndb:s632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s632","name":"紫苑 みやび","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:83844:174721:4918:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31634","characterName":"アーニャ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"174722","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"83844"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17031"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31634"},"originalCharacterName":"アーニャ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"B78 W52 H79"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に仕える、ドジでお茶目な使い魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情がくるくる変化。喜怒哀楽を身振り手振りで表現する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アーニャ本人は、主に仕える事が至上の喜びであるらしく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぞんざいな扱いを受けているにも関わらず、一生懸命に身辺世話をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17031","sourceWorkId":"10396","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に仕える下級の使い魔。 主人公を「ご主人様」と呼び、慕っている。 感情の起伏が激しく、悪魔にしては珍しいドジでお茶目な性格。 楽しい事、嬉しい事、悲しい事に、身振り手振りで表現する。 アーニャ本人は、主に仕える事が至上の喜びであるらしく、 ぞんざいな扱いを受けているにも関わらず、一生懸命に身辺世話をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174722"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17031","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"147 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17031","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17031","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17031","sourceWorkId":"10396","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8db02104d738825d63d3583e52bbe0c6a47f7f2115c325e0adc203dc2a0d34b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc55c8